This project depends on third-party libraries (numpy, scipy, soundfile,
librosa, pyloudnorm, scikit-learn, tqdm, langdetect, matplotlib, and
optionally openai-whisper, torch/torchaudio). Each carries its own license
(mostly BSD/MIT/Apache-2.0) -- check requirements.txt and each package's own
license before redistributing, especially if your GTV program has its own
licensing rules.
